{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CT6JZeC1v91795598347.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名港人乘坐香港快運航班，由日本東京返港，懷疑被人偷去財物，損失近16萬元。據了解，事主是前AV女演員濱崎真緒。</p><p></p><p>據了解，事主周二乘坐香港快運編號UO625航班，從東京返港，登機後將背囊放到機艙手提行李架。飛機抵港後，事主完成入境程序、乘的士回家後，發現背囊內總值約15.8萬元的珠寶首飾及手表不翼而飛，於是報警。警方暫列盜竊案處理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:43:56.728130+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T08:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:15:11.818997+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T10:37:18.662464+00:00","content_hash":"252f917496e44b594e939c63dabd53800ad78066ae2d1068b75165d69db4cc5e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:43:56.728130+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}